@startuml
title D-05 Payment, Fiscal, and Reconciliation Reporting Flow

actor "Finance /\nRevenue Assurance User" as Finance
participant "Management Dashboard" as Dash
participant "Central PMS\nReporting Facade" as CPMS
database "Central PMS canonical\npayment records" as Store
database "Central PMS fiscal\ncoordination references" as FiscalStore

Finance -> Dash : Request scoped payment summary
Dash -> CPMS : GET summary with explicit\nSITE/SITE_GROUP and UTC period
CPMS -> Store : Read canonical attempts,\nconfirmations, outcomes, and rails
Store --> CPMS : Scope-bounded aggregates
CPMS --> Dash : Partial internal-consistency report\nwith source and freshness metadata

Finance -> Dash : Request scoped fiscal exception summary
Dash -> CPMS : GET fiscal summary with explicit\nSITE/SITE_GROUP and UTC period
CPMS -> FiscalStore : Read persisted coordination references\nand related confirmation amounts
FiscalStore --> CPMS : Scope-bounded lifecycle\nand supported exception aggregates
CPMS --> Dash : Partial fiscal exception summary\nwith source and freshness metadata

note over CPMS, Store
No provider or POS Server call occurs during report generation.
The report does not prove settlement, payout, bank deposit,
cash custody, fees, refunds, disputes, or fiscal remittance.
Fiscal reporting does not prove printing, delivery, adjustment,
void, reprint, BIR compliance, or document values.
end note
@enduml
